{"manifest_version": 3, "name": "ACV - AI Content Verifier", "version": "1.2.1", "description": "Ki\u1ec3m ch\u1ee9ng n\u1ed9i dung v\u0103n b\u1ea3n, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 trang web \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n d\u1ea5u hi\u1ec7u AI, deepfake v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng tin sai l\u1ec7ch. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qu\u00e9t nhanh, xem chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 l\u01b0u l\u1ecbch s\u1eed c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9.", "browser_specific_settings": {"gecko": {"id": "acv-extension@example.com", "data_collection_permissions": {"required": ["browsingActivity", "websiteContent", "websiteActivity"], "optional": ["technicalAndInteraction"]}}}, "action": {"default_popup": "src/popup/index.html", "default_icon": {"16": "public/icon16.png", "32": "public/icon32.png", "48": "public/icon48.png", "128": "public/icon128.png"}}, "icons": {"16": "public/icon16.png", "32": "public/icon32.png", "48": "public/icon48.png", "128": "public/icon128.png"}, "permissions": ["activeTab", "storage", "scripting", "contextMenus"], "host_permissions": ["<all_urls>"], "web_accessible_resources": [{"matches": ["<all_urls>"], "resources": ["*.js", "*.css", "public/*"]}], "options_ui": {"page": "src/options/index.html", "browser_style": false}, "background": {"scripts": ["service-worker-loader.js"], "type": "module"}}